## Integration with lplan Workflow

### Mapping Team Process to Scale-Based Workflow

**Small Changes** (lplan: entity update only)
- Example: status bump from IDEA to PLANNING
- Your team: [who can do this, does it need review, log it?]
- Action: [auto, or notify someone?]

**Medium Changes** (lplan: entity + CHANGELOG)
- Example: design completed, project unblocked
- Your team: [does this need approval? deployment?]
- Action: [update CHANGELOG immediately, notify blockers?]

**Large Changes** (lplan: entity + CHANGELOG + FOCUS.md + REFLECTION.md)
- Example: strategy pivot, major blocker resolution
- Your team: [who decides? how is it communicated? all-hands meeting?]
- Action: [FOCUS.md rewrite, team discussion, update REFLECTION.md]

**Massive Changes** (lplan: large + re-eval related entities)
- Example: architectural rethink, major discovery
- Your team: [escalation path? who approves? roadmap impact?]
- Action: [steering committee review? RFC process?]

