## Quick Reference

### Check Current Status
```bash
cat plan/FOCUS.md              # What are we doing right now?
cat plan/INDEX.md              # Current state of all entities
head -20 plan/CHANGELOG.md     # Recent decisions
```

### Make a Change
```bash
# Small change
git add plan/projects/P001.md
git commit -m "Update P001 status"

# Medium change
# (also update CHANGELOG.md)
git add plan/projects/P001.md plan/CHANGELOG.md
git commit -m "P001 status change + CHANGELOG entry"

# Large change
# (also update FOCUS.md and REFLECTION.md)
git add plan/ CHANGELOG.md FOCUS.md REFLECTION.md
git commit -m "Large change: [summary] + workflow updates"
```

### Before Pulling
```bash
# Check if lplan changed
git diff deps/lplan/ -- WORKFLOW.md

# Read what changed
cat deps/lplan/WORKFLOW.md | head -50
```

